# jemdoc: title{Research | Junren Chen}
== Research


== Research Interests
I am interested in high-dimensional statistics, nonconvex optimization, machine learning, mathematics of data, signal processing, randomized algorithm, and problems in related areas. My research seeks to understand the information-theoretic limits of and develop fast algorithms for specific problems. 


== Selected Papers (by Topic)

See [https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=pw3tOroAAAAJ&hl=en Google Scholar] for full list.

